    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi action-RTS set on an alien planet at the outskirts of known space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A previously docile alien species has suddenly begun to attack a newly established\u00a0human outpost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the conscript soldiers tasked with the guarding of the outpost and try to survive the alien attack and to escape\u00a0with your life.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the troops, upgrade your equipment, explore the planet, and find a way to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Sector YAMA Features =-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Command troops in real-time combat with dozens of units on screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the map to find new allies, resources, and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture production points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy enemy bases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Participate in an epic space-opera story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultra-casual controls - can play with a single gamepad stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as Soldier - who was abandoned by the military command on an alien planet and who has to take the command in his own hands to escape the war and save his life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Gameplay mechanics\u00a0 =-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allied troops will automatically follow the player and attack enemies in range. The player's primary job is to gather a large force of allied troops, and then defeat enemy troops by tactically balancing his own position in a way that protects his allies from harm while also keeping himself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game length: 3+ hours</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi action-RTS set on an alien planet at the outskirts of known space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A previously docile alien species has suddenly begun to attack a newly established\u00a0human outpost. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the conscript soldiers tasked with the guarding of the outpost and try to survive the alien attack and to escape\u00a0with your life.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the troops, upgrade your equipment, explore the planet, and find a way to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Sector YAMA Features =-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Command troops in real-time combat with dozens of units on screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the map to find new allies, resources, and secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Capture production points</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Destroy enemy bases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Participate in an epic space-opera story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultra-casual controls - can play with a single gamepad stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play as Soldier - who was abandoned by the military command on an alien planet and who has to take the command in his own hands to escape the war and save his life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-= Gameplay mechanics\u00a0 =-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allied troops will automatically follow the player and attack enemies in range. The player's primary job is to gather a large force of allied troops, and then defeat enemy troops by tactically balancing his own position in a way that protects his allies from harm while also keeping himself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game length: 3+ hours</p>",
    "short_description": "Sci-fi military action-rts. Play as a space soldier, abandoned by the command on an alien planet. Find allies, gather resources, train new troops, and escape from Sector Yama. Casual &quot;single-stick shooter&quot; controls, fun tactical combat, rewarding exploration, and rich storytelling.",
